eovpn-pro (1.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release version 1.5.0.
  * Added full Persian (Farsi) RTL localization and dynamic switching.
  * Added concurrent multi-threaded TCP latency test & dynamic sorting.
  * Redesigned connection statistics card with live /proc/net/dev bandwidth monitoring.
  * Added OpenVPN 3 Data Channel Offload (DCO) toggle.
  * Added live server search, smart filtering (All/Favorites/Online/Offline) and star-marked favorite servers.
  * Security hardening: removed OTP logging, added delete-all confirmation dialog, safe ZIP size caps,
    staging download (no config loss on failed updates), safe redirects and zip-bomb protection.
  * Updated application ID to com.github.mahdi-arts.eovpn-pro to match the repository.
  * Fixed off-by-one in last-connected cursor restore and thread-safety of IP lookup UI updates.
  * Added linting (flake8), unit tests for the server filter, and an active CI/CD workflow (.deb + Flatpak).
  * Added bilingual CONTRIBUTING.md, SECURITY.md, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md and docs/RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md.

 -- Mahdi Bagheban <info@MahdiArts.ir>  Sat, 22 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0330
